      <p>We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of the Service at any time, with or without notice. We may also update features, pricing, and usage limits. Continued use of the Service after changes constitutes acceptance of the modified terms.</p>

      <h2>12. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. We will notify you of material changes by posting the new Terms in the app and updating the "Last updated" date. Your continued use after changes indicates acceptance.</p>

      <h2>13. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with applicable laws, without regard to conflict of law provisions.</p>

      <h2>14. Dispute Resolution</h2>
      <p>Any disputes arising from these Terms or your use of the Service shall first be attempted to be resolved through good-faith negotiation. If unresolved, disputes will be settled through binding arbitration in accordance with applicable rules.</p>

      <h2>15. Severability</h2>
      <p>If any provision of these Terms is found to be unenforceable or invalid, that provision shall be limited or eliminated to the minimum extent necessary, and the remaining provisions shall remain in full force and effect.</p>

      <h2>16. Entire Agreement</h2>
      <p>These Terms, together with our Privacy Policy, constitute the entire agreement between you and Wordream regarding the use of the Service, superseding any prior agreements.</p>

      <h2>Contact Information</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at: <a href="mailto:support@wordream.com">support@wordream.com</a></p>

      <a href="/" class="legal-back"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Home</a>
